### Test labTestId inclusion in pharmacy orders API response

# First, login as admin to get auth token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@health.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

# Use the token from above to access pharmacy orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders?orderType=lab_test
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}